ght:700">So who died, exactly=3F</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25p=
x georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Darya Shipilova, a 28-yea=
r-old employee of Irkutsk=E2=80=99s Anti-Plague Institute of Siberia and th=
e Far East, seems to have died of a mysterious pneumonia illness earlier th=
is month. Her death prompted Russian health authorities to quarantine emplo=
yees and patients at the hospital where she died, along with the institute=
=E2=80=99s staff and other people who were in contact with her.</span></p><=
p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px">=
<span style=3D"font-weight:700">Wait =E2=80=94 the plague still exists=3F</=
span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:=
0 0 15px"><span>Yes. The plague has been with us for a very long time. Yers=
inia pestis, the bacteria that causes plague, has </span><a href=3D"https:/=
/nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/TaCpRE6ScG39meF3aIpMcw~~/AAAAARA~/FrNOysh60_8P=
TmZsZMtS8DXhF40cbcG_Su4As7CKtZh24xCRBQDKVPQzaYwZ_eCwhqvN9hzzb-KWkq4KUaAHVvA=
