"color:#286ed0;-webkit-text-decoration:underline;text-decoration:underline"=
>covered up information</a><span>.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/2=
5px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>In the immediate afterm=
ath of Shipilova=E2=80=99s death, Russian authorities were terse. They fail=
ed to clarify her whereabouts before her death, or to address questions abo=
ut whether an accident had taken place at the institute.</span></p><table b=
